    "\n",
    "# Introduction\n",
    "\n",
    "Hash tables are omniscient in the software world and we use them a lot. I recently watched Matt Kulukundis' CppCon 2017 talk, [Designing a fast, efficient, cache-friendly hash Table, step by step](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ncHmEUmJZf4). In this blog-post, I would like to explore the implementation details of the abseil library's `flat_hash_map` data-structure. "
   ]
